za       - open/close region
zR       - open all regions
zM       - close all regions
alt+a    - buffer left
alt+d    - buffer right
alt+e    - move buffer left 
alt+q    - move buffer right
alt+t    - terminal
alt+g    - termimal tab
alt+x    - exit terminal mode (only in terminal mode)
ctrl+w h - move to the window on the left
ctrl+w j - move to the window below
ctrl+w k - move to the window above
ctrl+w l - move to the window on the right
ctrl+w t - move to the TOP window
ctrl+w b - move to the BOTTOM window
